asses through the lower shape, which is labeled 1, tubular inlet.  \n2. Then immediately enters the cylindrical part or directly into the shell? In the diagram, there might be intermediate parts.\n\nIn ID:4 description:  \n- The assembly from bottom to top (since flow upward):  \n  - Bottom: the shape for tubular inlet (1) with dashed lines (perforated disks)\n  - Then a narrow horizontal rectangular band (probably a flange or connector)\n  - Then the large central rectangle: shell 2  \n   - Then another narrow band\n   - Then the upper shape: for tubular outlet (9)\n\nBut the shell is where the deposition happens.\n\nComponents: the tubular inlet consists of several parts: conical section, cylindrical section, step widening surface.\n\nSimilarly for outlet.\n\nIn the flow path, when it enters, it first encounters the inlet components.\n\nThen immediately after the inlet, it goes into the shell.\n\nSpecifically for first component.\n\nSince the arrow 7 is at the bottom pointing up, it enters the bottom device which is tubular inlet 1.\n\n然后进入外壳 2。\n\n紧接着经过外壳后，是管状出口 9。\n\n但问题问紧接着，也就是入口后或首先后。\n\n知识库没有指定第七页的图示细节，但图2描述可以推断。\n\nAlso, in the text, ID:1 says: \"管状入口1...然后台阶形截止面5, 圆柱部分4, 等等。\"\n\n但未指定顺序。\n\nFor the flow direction: based on ID:1 and ID:4, with arrow 7 upward.\n\n在ID:1中说：\"气流方向如箭头7所示\" and \"壳2和管状出口9\" – 但未说入口位置。\n\n 在ID:4的视觉描述中，气流7向上，底部有组件1（入口），顶部有9（出口）。\n\nSo for the flow:\n- First passes through tubular inlet (1), specifically its components (conical part, etc.)\n- Then immediately passes into the shell (2)\n- After shell, through tubular outlet (9)\n\n但对于\"首先经过哪个部件\"，可能指的是入口的第一个部件。\n\n部件如4、5、6等。\n\n问题没有指定部件编号，所以可能需要用通用术语或引用中的名称。\n\n可能基于描述。\n\n在知识库中，ID:3详细描述了管状入口：\"在管状入口（1）的圆锥形部分（10）中设有三个配气带孔盘\"和\"在外壳的气体入口侧前接管状入口（1）\"。\n\n对于气流方向7，从底部向上，在进入入口时，首先是入口的圆锥部分，其中含有带孔盘。\n然后经过台阶和圆柱部分，才能进入外壳。\n\n在入口结构: 从ID:4描述，底部形态（管状入口）有带孔盘，所以气流首先遇到这些带孔盘。\n\n然后进入外壳。\n\n之后在出口处同样地。\n\n但对于问题：\"首先经过哪个部件？\" 在上下文中，部件可能如4（圆柱部分）、5（台阶截止面）、6（带盘孔盘）。\n\n在知识库ID:1中：\"配气带孔盘6，6'，6''以间隔x1到x3分布，间隔x1