"\n          },\n          \"op\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Operator from allowed list.\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"contains\",\n              \"not contains\",\n              \"in\",\n              \"not in\",\n              \"start with\",\n              \"end with\",\n              \"empty\",\n              \"not empty\",\n              \"=\",\n              \"≠\",\n              \">\",\n              \"<\",\n              \"≥\",\n              \"≤\"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"key\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"op\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"conditions\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}\n```\n\n**Current Task**:\n- Today's date: 2026-06-12\n- Available metadata keys: {}\n- User query: \"根据文本信息，该静电除尘器的发明人是？###According to the text information, the inventor of the electrostatic precipitator is?\"\n"
